          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Introduction",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 28.020000457763672,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              99.0,
              75.60729217529297,
              237.41876220703125,
              103.62728881835938
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This handbook describes the United States (U.S.) aviation weather program, products, and services. It also ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.979999542236328,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              111.5824203491211,
              542.6561889648438,
              122.56242370605469
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "documents weather theory and its application to aviation. The objective of this handbook is to help the pilot ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.979999542236328,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              124.26241302490234,
              542.53662109375,
              135.24241638183594
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "and operator understand the basics of weather, aviation weather hazards, and aviation weather products. ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.979999542236328,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              136.92245483398438,
              542.8049926757812,
              147.90245056152344
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The information included is not prescriptive. Furthermore, the guidance and recommendations in this ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.979999542236328,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              149.58242797851562,
              542.5258178710938,
              160.5624237060547
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "handbook are not legally binding in their own right and will not be relied upon by the FAA as a separate ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.979999542236328,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              162.24246215820312,
              542.74609375,
              173.2224578857422
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "basis for affirmative enforcement action or other administrative penalty. Conformity with the guidance and ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.979999542236328,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              174.90243530273438,
              542.55859375,
              185.88243103027344
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "recommendations is solely voluntary and nonconformity will not affect rights and obligations under existing ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.979999542236328,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              187.50247192382812,
              542.5964965820312,
              198.4824676513672
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "statutes and regulations. ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.979999542236328,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              200.16244506835938,
              180.72499084472656,
              211.14244079589844
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The handbook is a consolidated source of weather information and, in some cases, best practices to assist ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.979999542236328,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              218.82241821289062,
              542.405029296875,
              229.8024139404297
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "with providing safety for flight.",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.979999542236328,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              231.48245239257812,
              210.96287536621094,
              242.4624481201172
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The visualization of the products discussed in this handbook has evolved over the past decade with the use ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.979999542236328,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              250.14242553710938,
              542.7389526367188,
              261.1224060058594
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "of internet websites. The use of static black and white depictions of aviation forecasts is quickly becoming ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.979999542236328,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              262.7424621582031,
              542.7718505859375,
              273.7224426269531
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "a thing of the past. Today’s websites provide the products in color and offer options to select and overlay ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.979999542236328,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              275.4024353027344,
              542.42822265625,
              286.3824157714844
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "multiple pieces of weather information. ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.979999542236328,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              288.06243896484375,
              248.52499389648438,
              299.04241943359375
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Today’s aviation weather websites, including those of the National Weather Service (NWS), continue to ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.979999542236328,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              306.7224426269531,
              542.7488403320312,
              317.7024230957031
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "improve the content and visualization of products. Unfortunately, it is not practical to update this handbook ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.979999542236328,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              319.3824462890625,
              542.7269897460938,
              330.3624267578125
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "with every change to a weather product. ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.979999542236328,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              332.0424499511719,
              251.0449981689453,
              343.0224304199219
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Examples of weather products in this handbook represent one way of how they can be visualized on a user’s ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.979999542236328,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              350.6424560546875,
              542.8049926757812,
              361.6224365234375
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "viewing device (e.g., computer, tablet, mobile phone, or cockpit display). The examples shown in this ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.979999542236328,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              363.3024597167969,
              542.7570190429688,
              374.2824401855469
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "handbook are from NWS websites. ",
            "font_name": "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
            "font_size": 10.979999542236328,
            "color": "#000000",
            "is_bold": false,
            "is_italic": false,
            "bbox": [
              72.0,
              375.9624328613281,
              229.02499389648438,
              386.9424133300781
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This handbook is broken into three parts: ",
